# runtime output — always regenerable from the canonical model
out/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# local project data that must never be committed
projects/*/renders/
projects/*/concept-render/
projects/*/private/
# 临时验证项目（跑测试/验收脚本留下的），只有 demo-120 是随仓库分发的示例
projects/test-*/
projects/*/out/


# local platform credentials — never committed
omniailab.config.json
**/omniailab.config.json
providers/omniailab.api.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# media and binary assets — never committed (guard: scripts/check_assets.py)
#
# This repository carries *data*: the canonical model, drawings as DXF,
# knowledge, prompts, code and documentation. Reference photographs, site
# videos, exported renders, delivered PPTX, fonts and archives do not belong
# here — they are large, undiffable, unverifiable by a test, and permanent once
# pushed. When such a file is genuinely needed, record its **external location
# and digest** in a JSON data file and let the consumer fetch it on demand.
# A single file of 1 MB or more counts as a large file and is refused outright.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

